sections.body:
IoU 是候选与参考前景的交集像素数除以并集像素数。下面用 7×7 二值网格演示，1 是前景；参考应由人先固定，不能把模型自己的蒙版拿来当答案。保存为 mask-score.mjs，运行 node mask-score.mjs。

```js
/**
 * @file Compare two binary masks; this is not a segmentation model.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-10-30
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-10-30
 */
/**
 * Compare equal-size binary grids without changing either input.
 * @param {string[]} gold Human-approved rows containing only 0 and 1.
 * @param {string[]} pred Candidate rows, using the same pixel coordinates.
 * @returns {{iou: number|null, missed: number, extra: number}} Pixel counts and IoU.
 */
export function scoreMask(gold, pred) {
  /** @param {string[]} rows Grid. @returns {boolean} Whether it is a nonempty rectangle. */
  const valid = rows => Array.isArray(rows) && rows.length > 0 &&
    typeof rows[0] === 'string' && rows[0].length > 0 &&
    Array.from(rows).every(row => typeof row === 'string' &&
      row.length === rows[0].length && /^[01]+$/.test(row));
  if (!valid(gold) || !valid(pred) || gold.length !== pred.length ||
      gold[0].length !== pred[0].length) throw new TypeError('Invalid mask pair');
  let intersection = 0, union = 0, missed = 0, extra = 0;
  for (let y = 0; y < gold.length; y++) {
    for (let x = 0; x < gold[0].length; x++) {
      const g = gold[y][x] === '1', p = pred[y][x] === '1';
      if (g && p) intersection++;
      if (g || p) union++;
      if (g && !p) missed++;
      if (!g && p) extra++;
    }
  }
  return { iou: union ? intersection / union : null, missed, extra };
}
const gold = ['0000000', '0011100', '0010100', '0011100',
              '0001000', '0001100', '0000000'];
const filledHole = [...gold]; filledHole[2] = '0011100';
const lostTooth = [...gold]; lostTooth[5] = '0001000';
console.log('filledHole', scoreMask(gold, filledHole));
console.log('lostTooth', scoreMask(gold, lostTooth));
```

正文代码在 Node.js 22.16.0 实跑，参考共有 11 个前景像素：

| 候选 | IoU | 漏前景 missed | 多前景 extra | 仍须单独验收 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 填实钥匙孔 | 11/12 ≈ 0.917 | 0 | 1 | 孔是否保持透明 |
| 丢掉一颗齿 | 10/11 ≈ 0.909 | 1 | 0 | 齿是否完整 |

两者都超过假设的 0.90 线，仍应退回；这不是生产阈值建议。实际批次另列“关键孔洞、细柄、齿、徽记是否完整”，不能只取全图平均。两幅都没有前景时函数返回 iou=null，表示没有可评分对象，不当作满分。

代码只算二值几何，不评价 RGB 残色、连续 Alpha、视觉中心或美术风格。本次结果来自手工网格，不是 SAM 2 准确率，也没有模型效果对比。
